===== CMD: cambus (6.0s) =====
[sscma] === BUS PROBE ===
[sscma] 1) clocking with CS HIGH (Himax should ignore)
[sscma]   CSHIGH rx: FF FF FF FF FF FF FF FF FF FF FF FF FF FF FF FF FF FF FF FF FF FF FF FF FF FF FF FF FF FF FF FF
[sscma] 2) RST LOW (chip in reset), CS LOW
[sscma]   RST_LO rx: FF FF FF FF FF FF FF FF FF FF FF FF FF FF FF FF FF FF FF FF FF FF FF FF FF FF FF FF FF FF FF FF
[sscma] 3) RST HIGH (release), waiting 1.2s, then CS LOW
[sscma]   RUN    rx: FC F0 C0 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
[sscma] 4) same as 3 but at 200 kHz
[sscma]   SLOW   rx: 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
[sscma] 5) SYNC line over 3s (expander pin 6)
[sscma]   t=0 SYNC=1
[sscma]   t=3000 SYNC=1 (final)
[sscma] === PROBE DONE ===
[sscma] Interpretation:
[sscma]   - CSHIGH identical to RUN   => MISO pulled up elsewhere, Himax NOT responding
[sscma]   - CSHIGH all 0xFF, RUN differs => Himax IS responding (good)
[sscma]   - RST_LO all 0x00/0xFF, RUN differs => Himax reset line works
[sscma]   - SYNC never toggles over 3s => Himax firmware not queuing events

